0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; \"&gt; Finally! Our Save the Dates are complete! We decided not to do formal invitations because, well, its a verrrry small wedding. On the bright side, by having a limited guest list, we can pay attention to the extra special details. We&#039;re sending them in a pre-wedding mailer that includes a booklet with travel\/event info and a sweet treat.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; \"&gt; *&lt;span style=\"font-size:10px;\"&gt;The&amp;nbsp;monogram on the cover tag was designed using&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Arms&lt;\/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;and Times New Roman fonts. On the second tag, I used&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;Sloop Script&lt;\/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;and Times New Roman.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"text-align: justify; \"&gt;  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;img alt=\"_MG_9312.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469493\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  STD front tag  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;img alt=\"_MG_9306.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469491\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  STD back tag  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;img alt=\"_MG_9346.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469495\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  Pre-Wedding Mailer Packaging  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;img alt=\"_MG_9323.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469497\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  Outside Pre-Wedding Mailer  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;img alt=\"_MG_9324.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469499\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;  Inside Pre-Wedding Mailer  &amp;nbsp;  &amp;nbsp;  &amp;nbsp; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1478146,"PostDate":1309294738,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <div  style=\"text-align: justify\"> <p  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> Finally! Our Save the Dates are complete! We decided not to do formal invitations because, well, its a verrrry small wedding. On the bright side, by having a limited guest list, we can pay attention to the extra special details. We're sending them in a pre-wedding mailer that includes a booklet with travel\/event info and a sweet treat.\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 0px\"> *<span  style=\"font-size:10px\">The\u00a0monogram on the cover tag was designed using\u00a0<i>Arms<\/i>\u00a0and Times New Roman fonts. On the second tag, I used\u00a0<i>Sloop Script<\/i>\u00a0and Times New Roman.<\/span><\/p> <\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: justify\">  \u00a0  <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"_MG_9312.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469493\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span>  STD front tag  \u00a0  <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"_MG_9306.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469491\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span>  STD back tag  \u00a0  <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"_MG_9346.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469495\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span>  Pre-Wedding Mailer Packaging  \u00a0  <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"_MG_9323.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/469497\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span>  Outside Pre-Wedding Mailer  \u00a0  <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"_MG_9324.JPG\"