asPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210989.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":136,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"fungirl97","Id":210989,"Name":"fungirl97","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62018,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c7dc31f7ffa3418df8c490a32761f21","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These are the most gorgeous cutest little things i&#039;ve seen in&amp;nbsp;a long time!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Ok so I need details please:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; You ordered these or made them?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; What kind of plastic container are they in?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Your lollipops didn&#039;t melt?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; i can&#039;t wait to see what else you have for your wedding - I know yours is going to be one of my favorites!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1482696,"PostDate":1310056549,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are the most gorgeous cutest little things i've seen in\u00a0a long time!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ok so I need details please:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You ordered these or made them?<\/p> <p> What kind of plastic container are they in?<\/p> <p> Your lollipops didn't melt?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> i can't wait to see what else you have for your wedding - I know yours is going to be one of my favorites!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278364504,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62018,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d436854c2ad21fcd91ca73fb5e9e1d0","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]dominiqueamber[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n These are the most gorgeous cutest little things i&#039;ve seen in a long time! \n \n Ok so I need details please: \n \n You ordered these or made them? \n What kind of plastic container are they in? \n Your lollipops didn&#039;t melt? \n \n i can&#039;t wait to see what else you have for your wedding - I know yours is going to be one of my favorites![\/quote] \n \n Hi :) \n I made them myself. I printed on cardstock tags (large size) from Michaels. The plastic containers are also from michaels, they are photo boxes. And no, the lollipops didn&#039;t melt. I delivered my packages either by hand (if they were in town) or next day air (expensive, but I only have a little over a dozen guests).  \n Thank you so much for the positive feedback. I worked so hard on this wedding and it warms my heart to know that my time was well spent. Also, I have other threads where I posted my OOT bags, flowers and engagement pics. Thanks again!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1483314,"PostDate":1310142139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>dominiqueamber<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> These are the most gorgeous cutest little things i've seen in\u00a0a long time!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ok so I need details please:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You ordered these or made them?<\/p> <p> What kind of plastic container are they in?<\/p> <p> Your lollipops didn't melt?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> i can't wait to see what else you have for your wedding - I know yours is going to be one of my favorites!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hi <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> I made them myself. I printed on cardstock tags (large size) from Michaels. The plastic containers are also from michaels, they are photo boxes. And no, the lollipops didn't melt. I delivered my packages either by hand (if they were in town) or next day air (expensive, but I only have a little over a dozen guests).\u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you so much for the positive feedback. I worked so hard on this wedding and it warms my heart to know that my time was well spent. Also, I have other threads where I posted my OOT bags, flowers and engagement pics. Thanks again!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"justnicole08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1294457585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235251.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"justnikki","Id":235251,"Name":"justnikki","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62018,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50f1cef7789597c76c7e63fbe25fde4e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Oh I forgot! The grommets were also from Michaels, and they were very easy to do.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1483316,"PostDate":1310142342,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Oh I forgot! The grommets were also from Michaels, and they were very easy to do.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"justnicole08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1294457585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235251.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"justnikki","Id":235251,"Name":"justnikki","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62018,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7dc068144668d50669003ccdad3d2ecb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; i love this, they look so good!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1483714,"PostDate":1310230958,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> i love this, they look so good!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stace_price@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1307750340,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241007.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SS2012","Id":241007,"Name":"SS2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62018,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfba6110e5193a1101b0a5db02fd87d6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Aloha Nikki,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How did you print onto the cardstock tags? I love the pink sparkly tag with the monogram! I went to the craft store and bought some cardstock tags yet I have no idea how to go about printing on them. Did you have it done somewhere or did you use a particular printing program?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks in advance for any information you can share with me!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1484583,"PostDate":1310410329,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Aloha Nikki,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How did you print onto the cardstock tags? I love the pink sparkly tag with the monogram! I went to the craft store and bought some cardstock tags yet I have no idea how to go about printing on them. Did you have it done somewhere or did you use a particular printing program?<\/p> <p> Thanks in advance for any information you can share with me!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angeladehi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1310409530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242209.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Angelade","Id":242209,"Name":"Angelade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62018,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"010094f94770f77f228b02ab7d67d87b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These are SOOO beautiful!! You are talented!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Can I ask where you got the starfish charms? I&#039;d love to add those to my OOT bag tags!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1484584,"PostDate":1310410602,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are SOOO beautiful!! You are talented!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Can I ask where you got the starfish charms? I'd love to add those to my OOT bag tags!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jamie.laughlin@fourseasons.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1300586210,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237972.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"J-me","Id":237972,"Name":"J-me","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62018,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47e050b702d7aacf97ffe54659cd9d3a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Aloha Nikki,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Can you please share with me what method you used to print on your cardstock tags? I really like the pink sparkly look with the monogram on it but I don&#039;t know how to go about doing that on my printer. Or did you get it printed at a special print shop? Did you have to make a template for that?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks so much for any information you can share with me!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1484682,"PostDate":1310423337,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Aloha Nikki,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Can you please share with me what method you used to print on your cardstock tags? I really like the pink sparkly look with the monogram on it but I don't know how to go about doing that on my printer. Or did you get it printed at a special print shop? Did you have to make a template for that?<\/p> <p> Thanks so much for any information you can share with me!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angeladehi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1310409530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242209.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Angelade","Id":242209,"Name":"Angelade","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":61,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
