t":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dded54dbff51052ec50d352124cf7f94","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; wow!&amp;nbsp; you&#039;re really talented...and you might have yourself a &#039;side hustle&#039; in the making!&amp;nbsp; beautiful job on your invites!!!&amp;nbsp; happy planning!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1455658,"PostDate":1305921898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> wow!\u00a0 you're really talented...and you might have yourself a 'side hustle' in the making!\u00a0 beautiful job on your invites!!!\u00a0 happy planning!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rashedah.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"137.53.241.7","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1304461292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239608.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"futuremrstgun","Id":239608,"Name":"futuremrstgun","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f89a1aa12ba1d24785641552f3e4001","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks! I&#039;m glad the instructions can help others. Nowwww..onto the next step!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1455760,"PostDate":1305940292,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks! I'm glad the instructions can help others. Nowwww..onto the next step!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sailor_x_8@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1289408907,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233856.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"X-Chan","Id":233856,"Name":"X-Chan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a2e64bf4b6f15651416574497558bf1f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These are beautiful! I plan on making my own invites too so thanks for the advice on the paper supplier :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1456196,"PostDate":1306087100,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are beautiful! I plan on making my own invites too so thanks for the advice on the paper supplier <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandy_pants123@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1287916644,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233455.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":189,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Manda123","Id":233455,"Name":"Manda123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5aff23a8ee6f4836e3f9743b89f9ee07","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; ehee hehee, that is a CUTE cat! : ) and great invites - thanks so much for the how-to. I would have never thought I could make something like this, but now I might just try it. : )&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1456301,"PostDate":1306104236,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> ehee hehee, that is a CUTE cat! : ) and great invites - thanks so much for the how-to. I would have never thought I could make something like this, but now I might just try it. : )<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"evekellyr@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.218.244.111","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1285717046,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232763.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellygrrrl","Id":232763,"Name":"kellygrrrl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd67d7e374031a28817ec6ccd7239150","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Great job!! They look professional!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1456318,"PostDate":1306107924,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great job!! They look professional!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/robertandyolonda\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/robertandyolonda<\/a><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/73980\/maggie-sottero-destiny-size-18#post_1617888\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/73980\/maggie-sottero-destiny-size-18#post_1617888<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/73426\/msredd-s-ridiculously-long-and-pic-heavy-planning-thread\/20#post_1614885\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/73426\/msredd-s-ridiculously-long-and-pic-heavy-planning-thread\/20#post_1614885<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/moon-palace-golf-spa-resort-all-inclusive\/reviews\/4648\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinati...<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msredd3129@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"73.194.165.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275877585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228936.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"msredd3129","Id":228936,"Name":"msredd3129","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":81,"TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":80},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
